[b]Bosses[/b]

Two original raid bosses, each made as a Hunyuan3D 2.1-assisted textured model, rigged and animated in Blender, with every frame drawn by the game client's renderer. The [b]Hollow Regent[/b] is a winged boss (idle hover, fly, attack, hit and death). The [b]Tidemark Sentinel[/b] is a stone-and-brass guardian (idle, walk, attack, hit and death). They're studies, not in the game yet: next comes conversion to the game's own animation format and NPC definitions, plus some clean-up (the Regent's wing edges, and the Sentinel's joints in deep bends).

