[b]NPC studies[/b]

Eleven original Old School-style NPC designs for the Tower, made as complete textured models with Hunyuan3D assistance: the Quarry Warden, Kiln Dwarf, Reed Goblin, Granary Ogre, Forgotten Watchman, Gravebell Keeper, Moorland Drake, Fen Hound, Ashback Beetle, Cavewing Bat and Copperwing Imp, shown at gameplay camera angles. These are studies: they aren't rigged, animated or in the game yet.

